; A job's candidates: clear drops them, their matches name nothing
; again, and a job's stale results are dropped.
> (jobs:define-worker (two-rounds input emit receive)
    (let ([p (receive)])
      (emit (vector "one" "two"))
      (emit 'clear)
      (emit (vector "three"))))
